# {{n-g|Used as a question to ask for further explanation of something said, often rhetorically or in a dismissive or impolite manner}}.
#: {{ux|en|"You park your car in front of my house every morning." — "'''So'''?"}}
# {{n-g|Used as a meaningless filler word to begin a response to a question.}}
#: {{ux|en|What are you doing? / '''So''' I'm just fixing this shelf.}}
