* Restricted to verbs which can take [[clausal complement]]s, such as those relating to communication (e.g. {{m|en|[[say]] so}}), knowledge or belief (e.g. {{m|en|[[think]] so}}, {{m|en|[[expect]] so}}), or action (e.g. {{m|en|[[do]] so}}), as well as [[stative verb]]s (e.g. {{m|en|[[seem]] so}}, {{m|en|[[remain]] so}}).

